                      "id": "UdjaX",
                      "name": "n",
                      "fill": "$text-mid",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "Chosen (Jason, 2026-09-18). Zero new rendering code, and the shape is pi's own favicon: the mono fallback pi.dev itself ships. The pixel grid stays crisp at 12 px. Tradeoff accepted: two neutral marks in the rail, Codex and pi, told apart by shape only — the knot is round, the π is square. Stopped, every option collapses to this grey anyway (#641).",
