                      "fill": "$text-low",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "Not taken. Coral is the logo's top bar and holds on both grounds, but it sits beside Claude's #D97757 and reads as the same family at 12 px. Had a colour been wanted, blue #4D9ABF was the pick: the one hue no provider and no status uses; yellow is the app's warning colour.",
